<title>UK: Novorossiisk oil pipelines closed for repairs.</title>
<headline>Novorossiisk oil pipelines closed for repairs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pipelines to Russia's main Black Sea oil output terminal Novorossiisk were closed at the weekend for repairs, a reliable shipping source said on Monday.</p>
<p>The crude and petroleum product pipelines to the 650,000 barrels per day (bpd) terminal were shut at 1100 hours local time on Saturday.</p>
<p>Two of the berths at Novorossiisk, berths two and three for smaller vessels, remained closed on Monday as part of maintenance which is expected to be complete by May 25.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 6280</p>
</text>
